cyane cyangwa buke uburyo bwo kugenda mu nzira nyabagendwa, ahakorerwa imirimo hagaragazwa ku buryo bukurikira\",\"option_a\":\"icyapa cyera cya mpande enye, zingana zifite uruhande rwa metero 0.30\",\"option_b\":\"uruzitiro ruri ku mpera y’iburyo\",\"option_c\":\"A na B ni ibisubizo by’ukuri\",\"option_d\":\"nta gisubizo cy’ukuri kirimo\",\"image_path\":null},{\"id\":167,\"correct_option\":\"A\",\"question\":\"Ni iyihe feri ituma imodoka igenda buhoro kandi igahagarara ku buryo bwizewe bubangutse kandi nyabwo, uko imodoka yaba yikoreye kose yaba igeze ahacuramye cyangwa ahaterera:\",\"option_a\":\"Feri y’urugendo\",\"option_b\":\"Feri yo gutabara\",\"option_c\":\"Feri yo guhagarara umwanya munini\",\"option_d\":\"Nta gisubizo cy’ukuri kirimo\",\"image_path\":null},{\"id\":144,\"correct_option\":\"C\",\"question\":\"Icyapa cyerekana ko bibujijwe kuvuza amahoni kirangwa na :\\r\\n\",\"option_a\":\"ishusho y’uruziga, ubuso bw’ubururu, ikiranga cy’umukara\",\"option_b\":\"ishusho y’uruziga, ubuso bw’ubururu, ikiranga cy’umweru\",\"option_c\":\"ishusho y’uruziga, ubuso bw’umweru, ikiranga cy’umukara\",\"option_d\":\"ntagisubizi cy’ukuri kirimo\",\"image_path\":null},{\"id\":174,\"correct_option\":\"A\",\"question\":\"Ibinyabiziga bifite ubugari bufite ibipimo bikurikira bigomba kugira amatara ndangaburumbarare :\",\"option_a\":\"Metero 2 na cm 10\",\"option_b\":\"Metero 2 na cm 50\",\"option_c\":\"Metero 3\",\"option_d\":\"Metero 2\",\"image_path\":null},{\"id\":20,\"correct_option\":\"A\",\"question\":\"Ibinyabiziga bikoreshwa nka tagisi,\\r\\nbitegerereza abantu mu nzira nyabagendwa,\\r\\nbishobora gushyirwaho itara ryerekana ko\\r\\nikinyabiziga kitakodeshejwe. Iryo tara\\r\\nrishyirwaho ku buryo bukurikira:\",\"option_a\":\"Ni itara ry’icyatsi rishyirwa imbere ku kinyabiziga\",\"option_b\":\"Ni itara ry’icyatsi rishyirwa ibumoso\",\"option_c\":\"Ni itara ry’umuhondo rishyirwa inyuma\",\"option_d\":\"A na C ni ibisubizo by’ukuri\",\"image_path\":null},{\"id\":8,\"correct_option\":\"D\",\"question\":\"Ikinyabiziga kibujijwe guhagarara akanya\\r\\nkanini aha hakurikira :\",\"option_a\":\"Ahatarengeje metero 1 imbere cyangwa inyuma y’ikinyabiziga gihagaze akanya gato cyangwa kanini \",\"option_b\":\"Ahantu hari ibimenyetso bibuza byabugenewe\",\"option_c\":\"Aho abanyamaguru banyura mu muhanda ngo bakikire inkomyi\",\"option_d\":\"Ibisubizo byose nibyo\",\"image_path\":null},{\"id\":26,\"correct_option\":\"B\",\"question\":\"Ikinyabiziga gishya gikenerwa gusuzumwa bwambere nyuma y’igihe kingana iki ?\",\"option_a\":\"Nyuma y’umwaka umwe\",\"option_b\":\"Nyuma y’imyaka ibiri\",\"option_c\":\"A na b ni ibisubizo by’ukuri \",\"option_d\":\"Nta gisubizo cy’ukuri\",\"image_path\":null},{\"id\":207,\"correct_option\":\"A\",\"question\":\"Ibiziga by’ibinyabiziga bigendeshwa na moteri n’ibya velomoteri kimwe n’ibya romoruki zabyo bigomba kuba byambaye inziga zihagwa zifite amano n’ubujyakuzimu butari munsi ya milimetero imwe ku migongo yabyo yose nubudodo bwabyo ntibugire ahantu na hamwe bugaragara kandi ntibugire aho byacitse bikomeye mu mpande zabyo ariko ibyo ntibikurikizwa ku binyabiziga bikurikira:\",\"option_a\":\"ibinyabiziga bidapakiye kandi bitajya birenza umuvuduko wa km 25 mu isaha ahateganye\",\"option_b\":\"ibinyabiziga bya police bijya ahatarenga km 25 uvuye aho biba\",\"option_c\":\"A na B ni ibisubizo by’ukuri\",\"option_d\":\"nta gisubizo cy’ukuri kirimo\",\"image_path\":null}]','186,156,123,185,58,88,2,229,61,226,205,109,230,167,144,174,20,8,26,207',1,9,10,'2026-07-02 19:23:08'),(3,'Gissel','0795670719',5,20,'{\"question_1\":\"A\",\"question_3\":\"A\",\"question_9\":\"A\",\"question_18\":\"A\",\"question_47\":\"A\",\"question_58\":\"C\",\"question_73\":\"A\",\"question_124\":\"A\",\"question_131\":\"A\",\"question_140\":\"A\",\"question_147\":\"A\",\"question_166\":\"A\",\"question_184\":\"A\",\"question_186\":\"A\",\"question_217\":\"B\",\"question_224\":\"A\",\"question_227\":\"A\",\"question_230\":\"A\"}','[{\"id\":21