inyuma n’amatara 2 atukura, bipfa kuba bitarenza ibipimo bikurikira:\",\"option_a\":\"kutarenza umuvuduko wa km20 mu isaha\",\"option_b\":\"uburebure bwabyo habariwemo ibyo bitwaye bukaba butarengeje m6\",\"option_c\":\"uburebure ntarengwa ntiburenga m8\",\"option_d\":\"A na B nibyo bisubizo by’ukuri\",\"image_path\":null},{\"id\":140,\"correct_option\":\"A\",\"question\":\"Icyi cyapa gisobanura :\",\"option_a\":\"ntihanyurwa mu byerekezo byombi\",\"option_b\":\"ntihanyurwa n’abandi uretse abahatuye\",\"option_c\":\"hanyurwa mu cyerekezo kimwe gusa\",\"option_d\":\"nta gisubizo cy’ukuri kirimo\",\"image_path\":\"9.jpg\"},{\"id\":18,\"correct_option\":\"D\",\"question\":\"Ikinyabiziga ntigishobora kugira amatara\\r\\narenga abiri y’ubwoko bumwe keretse\\r\\nkubyerekeye amatara akurikira:\",\"option_a\":\"Itara ndangamubyimba\",\"option_b\":\"Itara ryerekana icyerekezo\",\"option_c\":\"Itara ndangaburumbarare\",\"option_d\":\"Ibisubizo byose ni ukuri\",\"image_path\":null},{\"id\":227,\"correct_option\":\"C\",\"question\":\"Ibinyabiziga bikurikira ntibitegetswe kugira ibimenyetso bibyerekana iyo byambukiranya umuhanda cyangwa bigenda\\r\\nku ruhande rwawo:\",\"option_a\":\"ibinyabiziga bigendwamo n’abana\",\"option_b\":\"ibinyabiziga bigendwamo n’abamugaye\",\"option_c\":\"A na B ni ibisubizo by’ukuri\",\"option_d\":\"nta gisubizo cy’ukuri kirimo\",\"image_path\":null},{\"id\":125,\"correct_option\":\"B\",\"question\":\"Umuyobozi w’ikinyabiziga igihe atwaye ikinyabiziga akagira umunaniro utuma yasinzira yakora iki ?\",\"option_a\":\"Gufungura ikirahure cy’ikinyabiziga cyangwa gushyira ubukonje mu modoka kugirango umwuka mwiza winjire mu kinyabiziga\",\"option_b\":\"Guhagarara akaruhuka harimo no kugendagenda niba bishoboka\",\"option_c\":\"Kunanura amaboko no gufunga amaso mugihe gito\",\"option_d\":\"Kongera ubushyuhe mu kinyabiziga\",\"image_path\":null},{\"id\":34,\"correct_option\":\"A\",\"question\":\"Umuyobozi w’ikinyabiziga yakara iki mu gihe anyuzweho nikindi 